msgctxt "ARIMATimeSeries|"
msgid "Missing values"
msgstr "欠測値"

msgctxt "SpectralTimeSeries|"
msgid "Missing values"
msgstr "欠測値"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid ""
"Differences the dependent variable at the selected lag, repeated according "
"to Order. The first Lag × Order positions are retained as missing values (up "
"to the series length). Existing missing values also propagate into "
"differences that use them. Time series plots and saved transformations "
"retain these positions; stationarity tests and autocorrelation plots handle "
"them according to their own Missing values setting."
msgstr ""
"選んだラグで従属変数の差分をとり、「次数」の回数だけ繰り返します。先頭の ラ"
"グ × 次数 個の位置は、系列の長さを上限として欠測値のまま残ります。もとからあ"
"る欠測値も、それを使う差分に伝わります。時系列プロットと保存した変換結果はこ"
"れらの位置を保ち、定常性の検定と自己相関プロットはそれぞれの「欠測値」の設定"
"に従って扱います。"

msgctxt "StationarityTimeSeries|"
msgid "Missing values"
msgstr "欠測値"
